| 15 | the READER: two calls at once on two sources | no | the reader keeps no state between calls (DERIVED: `IppReader.cs:18` is its only static field); no cell; no claim beyond that sentence |
| 16 | the READER: a source whose read never returns; a source that reports more than it was asked for | the first: no; zero bytes for ever: yes (the format exception after one more read) | **Limit**, one sentence in the reader's comment; no code |
